{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o002b","title":"刘备少时言乘羽葆盖车","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o002b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备与宗族小儿在桑树下玩耍，说必当乘羽葆盖车，叔父子敬告诫不可妄言。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"言志","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0007","role":"告诫","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"刘备少时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002b-q"]},"source_order":[32,3,"O002b"],"order":6493}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0007","name":"子敬（刘备叔父）","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o002"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o002-xianzhu-p0007","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o002"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o002b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aa1599a2aaa9082c12d1","layer":"original","quote":"先主少时，与宗中诸小儿于树下戏。言：“吾必当乘此羽葆盖车〖7〗。”叔父子敬谓曰：“汝勿妄语，灭吾门也！”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":65,"end":117},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o002","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aa1599a2aaa9082c12d1","layer":"original","quote":"先主少孤，与母贩履织席为业。舍东南角篱上，有桑树生高五丈余，遥望见童童如小车盖〖6〗。往来者皆怪此树非凡，或谓“当出贵人”。﹝二﹞先主少时，与宗中诸小儿于树下戏。言：“吾必当乘此羽葆盖车〖7〗。”叔父子敬谓曰：“汝勿妄语，灭吾门也！”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
